    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's an interesting take. but what about the people who argue that sanctions are necessary? like, even if they aren't perfect, isn't it better to have some kind of consequence for human rights abuses than to just do nothing and let them get away with it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
